te/ZOMATO_27012026182242_Eternallimitedtranscriptofearningcallsigned.pdf","ts":"2026-01-27T18:23"}]},{"q":"FY26Q4","ql":"Q4 FY26","basis":"consolidated","label":"Strong","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/xbrl/INTEGRATED_FILING_INDAS_1660628_28042026082148_WEB.xml","ev":{"ts":"2026-04-28T20:11:45","src":"XBRL publish time (may be late)","day":0.4,"w1":1.3,"m1":-2.3},"docs":[{"k":"transcript","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_06052026135430_TranscriptfilingsignedApril2026.pdf","ts":"2026-05-06T13:57"}]},{"q":"FY27Q1","ql":"Q1 FY27","basis":"consolidated","label":"Strong","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/xbrl/INTEGRATED_FILING_INDAS_1699577_22072026071843_WEB.xml","ev":{"ts":"2026-07-22T19:17:12","src":"XBRL publish time (may be late)","day":0.9,"w1":8.2,"m1":14.2},"docs":[{"k":"transcript","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","ts":"2026-07-29T14:52"}],"cm":{"items":[{"field":"summary","statement":"Revenue +182% to Rs 20,211 cr as Blinkit consolidates fully; PAT +268% YoY to Rs 92 cr but -47% QoQ; Blinkit is 77.5% of revenue, QC NOV +86%.","quote":"Eternal (Zomato/Blinkit) — Q1 FY27 (results 22 Jul 2026) The business has flipped from a food-delivery company to a quick-commerce company: Blinkit is now 78% of revenue. Profit is thin and volatile as Eternal keeps investing in QC — the growth-vs-margin trade-off in full view. Numbers. Revenue Rs 20,211 cr (+182% YoY) — the jump reflects the shift to an inventory-led (1P) Blinkit model, which gro","doc_kind":"concall","kind":"written summary"},{"field":"improved","statement":"The company's profitability has improved as the platform has grown larger.","quote":"As the platform has gotten bigger, our profitability has improved. There is a certain amount that we keep reinvesting back into making our product prices more competitive","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"The company reduced its net working capital days due to lower inventory days than originally anticipated.","quote":"What has helped us reduce it from 18 to 14, and what we think will reduce it further to 12, is largely lower inventory days than we initially thought we would need to carry.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"The company has achieved productivity improvements across dark stores, warehouses, supply chain, marketing, and assortment.","quote":"The productivity gains are at the dark store level, at the warehouse level, supply chain, even our marketing is getting more efficient, assortment etc.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":17.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Blinkit experienced a drop in average order value during the quarter due to minor pattern changes.","quote":"The NAOV drop in Blinkit is still in the same range as was last year, but most of this drop is usually just related to small changes in the patterns that happen during the quarter.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"The cost of doing business rose during the quarter because multiple states raised their minimum wages.","quote":"There was some increase in the cost of doing business in the quarter because there were a lot of states which implemented increase in minimum wage.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"The number of monthly active restaurants experienced a minor decline due to the LPG situation.","quote":"That's why you probably see a slight dip in the monthly active restaurant count.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":17.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management expects the current high level of competitor discounting to decrease in the near future.","quote":"We expect this to not continue beyond the near future so we do think that this will come off.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management expects average order values to remain mostly flat, though they may rise temporarily in the third quarter due to seasonal factors.","quote":"In Q3, they might climb up again because of seasonality, but broadly, we don't think they should move up in a meaningful way.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The company expects to reach the upper end of its previously guided margin range.","quote":"we think at this point we're likely to end at the higher end of the range that we had guided earlier and hence, the communication.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The company estimates its steady-state net working capital will be 12 days.","quote":"The 12 days that we are saying here is a steady-state estimate right now.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"The company is experiencing strong growth in tier 1 cities despite some market share shifts.","quote":"Although we are still seeing robust growth in our tier 1 cities, we think there is some share shift also which happens over there","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Non-metro cities are experiencing faster growth rates due to starting from a lower base.","quote":"The non-metro cities are obviously growing faster because they're also growing off a smaller base.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"The company sets its product prices based on long-term sustainable levels rather than short-term competitor discounts.","quote":"Our baseline is usually what we think product prices can sustainably be in the long run, and that is what we index towards.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"High competitive intensity has led to lower product prices as the company matches competitor pricing.","quote":"Some of it can also just be related to lower product prices because there is a lot of competitive intensity, which also forces us to price match and a lot of things.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"The company faced higher operating costs due to minimum wage hikes across several states.","quote":"There was some increase in the cost of doing business in the quarter because there were a lot of states which implemented increase in minimum wage.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Last mile delivery costs typically increase during the first quarter due to summer weather conditions.","quote":"In Q1, the last mile costs are usually higher because of summer and heat and various other factors.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Increased store investments have provided the company with better visibility on its margins.","quote":"All these investments are clearly lining up in a way where we now have higher visibility on margins","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"Capex figures should be evaluated over the long term because warehousing investments create lumpiness.","quote":"We should look at this number more longer-term because there is a lumpiness in investment here because while we are presenting the information as capex per store, a large part of the capex is in warehousing","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"The company's capex per store is lower than 2.5 crore when analyzed over a longer time frame.","quote":"If you therefore look at our capex over the last six months, nine months or a longer period, and the capex per store for that period, you will find it is lower than INR 2.5 crore.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"The company is expanding its kitchen capacity at a rate of approximately ten kitchens per quarter.","quote":"Broadly, we are adding about 10-odd kitchens in a quarter, that's the pace of expansion there.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The company is developing Nugget, an enterprise AI product business that is seeing positive initial traction.","quote":"It's an enterprise AI product business and we are seeing good traction in that but it's an evolving market, as you know, the entire AI space.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":13.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The company is exploring new categories like retail stores and events within its District platform.","quote":"Amongst the newer ones, retail stores and events could be the more promising ones, but we are still early on that journey.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":15.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"The industry experienced its highest level of competitive intensity during the first quarter due to more aggressive players.","quote":"First quarter, so far, was the peak of competitive intensity that we have seen till date because the number of players is higher and everybody was more aggressive.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZOMATO_29072026145100_TranscriptfilingJuly222026.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"Competitors in the industry are primarily focusing on subsidizing grocery products.","quote":"Most competito